A recipe.

An ingredient has a name (text), grams (a number) and a vegan (yes or no).

The scaled of some ingredients (a list of ingredients) for some guests (a whole number) is a list of numbers:
its grams times the guests divided by 4 for each ingredient in the ingredients.

A dish (a list of ingredients) is vegan when:
its vegan for every ingredient in the dish.

Suppose flour is an ingredient with name "flour", grams 200 and vegan true.
Suppose butter is an ingredient with name "butter", grams 100 and vegan false.
For example, the scaled of a list of flour and butter for 8 joined with "," is "400,200".
For example, a list of flour is vegan.
For example, a list of flour and butter is not vegan.
